From 34ce5d940086c5aed1248152a48796d02d377fb3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jon West <electrikjesus@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 11:33:49 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 4/8] Taskbar: Keep a notifications bell in the system bar tray

The notifications group disappeared when there were none, leaving no
tray target for the notification panel. Show a bell when it's empty
(the count bubble or icons replace it), and on KitKat, where the groups
have no capsules, divide notifications from the status icons.

Change-Id: Iedac77de76fd99d8402fb0691ace9dcc6b054554
---
 .../drawable/ic_retro_tray_notifications.xml  | 19 ++++++++++++
 .../taskbar/TaskbarSystemTrayView.kt          | 31 ++++++++++++++-----
 2 files changed, 42 insertions(+), 8 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 quickstep/res/drawable/ic_retro_tray_notifications.xml

diff --git a/quickstep/res/drawable/ic_retro_tray_notifications.xml b/quickstep/res/drawable/ic_retro_tray_notifications.xml
