 /**
  * The tablet system bar tray: notification icons, network and battery, volume and the clock.
  *
- * Tapping the notifications opens the notification panel and tapping the status icons or the clock
- * opens Quick Settings, both on this taskbar's display. Material style draws Googlebook-like
- * capsules in the dynamic colors; KitKat style draws flat white icons and a thin Holo-blue clock.
+ * Tapping the notifications (a bell when there are none) opens the notification panel and tapping
+ * the status icons or the clock opens Quick Settings, both on this taskbar's display. Material
